<title>PHILIPPINES: Easycall 1995/96 net 70 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Easycall 1995/96 net 70 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paging company Easycall Communications Philippines Inc said on Monday it posted a 70 million net income for the fiscal year 1995-1996 ended June against a net loss of 22 million pesos in the previous year.</p>
</text>
